[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31900400_03_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31900400_03_9999","text":"爱依\\n"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31900400_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31900400_03_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31900400_03_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31900400_03_0004","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31900400_03_0005","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31900400_03_0008","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31900400_03_0010","text":"（啊……！　找到了！！）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31900400_03_0009","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31900400_03_0020","text":"（……天哪，超可爱的嘛！\n　超适合的，哥特萝莉……！！）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31900400_03_0006","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31900400_03_0030","text":"辛苦了，演唱会很棒啊……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31900400_03_0040","text":"谢谢制作人！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31900400_03_0050","text":"听我说！之前给我寄粉丝信的那个粉丝！\n她来了哦，穿着哥特萝莉裙！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31900400_03_0060","text":"哦哦……！\n那真是太好了！？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31900400_03_0070","text":"嗯，超开心！\n……而且，我觉得她超帅气的！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31900400_03_0080","text":"她可是克服了“会不会被笑啊、会不会搞砸啊”这样的担心\n鼓起勇气迈出了那一步呢！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31900400_03_0090","text":"哈哈，想到给她这份契机的就是爱依，\n我也觉得好开心，好自豪啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31900400_03_0100","text":"啊哈哈～，谢谢制作人\n我也会努力做帅气的“我”的～！！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31900400_03_0007","text":"Motion"}]
